            For most homes the EcoFlow DELTA 3 Plus is the right indoor generator: a kilowatt-hour of LiFePO4 storage, 1,800W of output, a sub-10-millisecond switchover and a published noise rating under 30 dB at the loads a fridge and a bedroom actually draw. If the job is mainly sleep equipment, the lighter Jackery Explorer 1000 v2 is easier to live with; if it is the whole house, the DELTA Pro 3 on a transfer switch is the only pick here that does it.
          </p>
